1
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,560
Yiran

2
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,720
Xiaofang

3
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,160
How did you do on the test?

4
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,160
Eighty.

5
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,200
Not bad!

6
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,600
Eight.

7
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:46,800
May Uncle Chen show some mercy.

8
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,320
My old man is used to it.

9
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,280
Ignore him. Let's go.

10
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,280
Come to my place for hot pot!

11
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:50,960
Let's go.

12
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,960
Sorry, sorry, sorry!

13
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,120
I'm sorry.

14
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,680
A rich girl like her

15
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,560
must be pretty carefree, right?

16
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,120
Definitely.

17
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,360
Unlike you, you little jinx.

18
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,240
What did you say?

19
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,400
You big loser.

20
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,280
Little jinx!

21
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,240
Yeah, I'm a little jinx.

22
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:33,920
Not only that,

23
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:35,240
I'm also a cheapskate.

24
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,360
Xiaofang, you're so generous.

25
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,120
You're not Xiaofang.

26
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,480
You're Dafang!

27
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,960
Chen Dafang, wait for me!

28
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,000
This is my overall presentation

29
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,400
on the returning youth project.

30
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,320
Thank you, directors.

31
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,520
Xiao Fan.

32
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:16,800
You're a top university media grad.

33
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,200
How can you not even catch a trend?

34
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,040
Last time,

35
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:24,560
that pet park incident was great, right?

36
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,720
You were right there,

37
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,640
yet you didn't break the story.

38
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,480
That is a serious failure on your part.

39
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,280
And look at this proposal of yours.

40
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,760
"Returning youth"?

41
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,880
It's just whining over nothing.

42
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,800
Director.

43
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,800
Actually, Xiao Fan's proposal

44
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,600
has its merits.

45
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,280
Her interviewee is

46
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:48,560
Chen Baixi, who returned from Beijing.

47
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,040
Baixi? Chen Baixi?

48
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,200
Chen Baixi, who returned from Beijing?

49
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,600
He's currently in the funeral business.

50
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,480
Enough, Lao Liu.

51
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,560
Are you out of your mind?

52
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,680
He gives up living in a nice big city

53
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:04,720
just to come back and run funerals?

54
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,840
He just lacks ambition.

55
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,600
You have to drop this project.

56
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,280
But...

57
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,000
But what?

58
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:14,880
What is it that I want?

59
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,240
I want traffic.

60
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,200
I want ad revenue!

61
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,200
Do you understand?

62
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:23,960
Director, I'll change direction right away.

63
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:25,360
Do it ASAP.

64
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,400
I can wait,

65
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,280
but the station can't.

66
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,880
Xiao Fan, have a seat.

67
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:44,400
Sit.

68
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,400
Listen, Xiao Fan...

69
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,040
Don't take it too hard.

70
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,480
The deputy director is under a lot of stress.

71
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,520
The ad sponsorships are still up in the air.

72
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,280
I understand.

73
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,360
Thank you, Director Liu.

74
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,320
By the way,

75
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:03,000
about the tea I gave Chairman Fan last time...

76
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,400
Did he enjoy it?

77
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,800
Whenever he's free,

78
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,920
would it be convenient for me to visit him?

79
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:13,040
My dad's been away on business lately.

80
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:15,760
I understand, of course.

81
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,600
He's a major entrepreneur, after all.

82
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,800
He must be extremely busy.

83
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,280
I'll go see the deputy director now.

84
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,360
As for the backup plan...

85
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,600
Thanks for your hard work.

86
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,000
Okay, I'll let you get back to work.

87
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:28,640
Okay.

88
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,440
You're not going.

89
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,360
What's your problem?

90
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,640
When I couldn't find a job,

91
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,640
you gave me a hard time.

92
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,640
Now that I found one, you won't let me go.

93
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,480
What do you want from me?

94
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,600
Are you out of your mind?

95
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:48,960
You don't have to listen to me.

96
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,320
Come here.

97
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,000
Dad,

98
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,680
she's going out to wash men's stinky feet.

99
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,360
Don't mind me.

100
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,720
Would you approve of this?

101
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,080
What is wrong with you?

102
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:58,640
Old Li,

103
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,080
it's the 21st century now.

104
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,200
Do you expect me, Li Yiran,

105
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,200
to still bind my feet?

106
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,280
I've even worked as an NPC before.

107
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,720
You think I'm scared of washing men's feet?

108
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,400
I'm not scared. Bless me.

109
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,120
Bless me, bless me.

110
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,000
Dad,

111
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,960
in those massage parlors,

112
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,440
so many men will try to take advantage of her.

113
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:18,000
Old Li, with my personality,

114
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,600
who would dare take advantage of me?

115
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,720
The man who tries to take advantage of me

116
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,920
hasn't even been born yet.

117
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:25,000
You might fend off the decent ones,

118
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,800
but how will you handle the creeps?

119
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,240
Are you worried about me?

120
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,160
That makes me feel so warm inside.

121
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:49,600
That job pays 3,500 a month.

122
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,600
Plus commissions.

123
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,400
And tips if I wash them well.

124
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,720
When an opportunity like this falls into my lap,

125
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,680
you won't let me go?

126
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,400
No, you can't go.

127
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,200
I've been out here for so long,

128
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,760
has any decent job ever come my way?

129
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,720
Anyway,

130
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,800
for a shady job like that,

131
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,000
you are simply not allowed to go.

132
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,800
I make money with my own hands and feet.

133
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,000
It's honest work.

134
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:08,760
Get out of my way.

135
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,920
Don't block my path to riches.

136
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,560
You...

137
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,920
Yiran, we got a job.

138
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,840
Come to Xiaoxitian.

139
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:18,800
On my way.

140
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:19,720
Hello?

141
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,560
Early in the morning...

142
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,920
None of you will let me speak, huh?

143
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:29,960
Weasel! Weasel!

144
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:34,720
The weasel is here! The weasel is here!

145
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,040
This car is pretty flashy.

146
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,560
How much is it?

147
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:45,080
Zhang Lijuan, stop pretending.

148
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:46,600
You just want to sit in his passenger seat, don't you?

149
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,200
Losers talk nonsense.

150
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,520
None of your damn business. Seriously.

151
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:52,160
This is one of those sports cars.

152
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,360
A sports car.

153
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:56,760
This car costs at least a million.

154
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:02,440
Chunguang Alley is truly honored today.

155
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,520
Hey, handsome.

156
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,360
Do you want...

157
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:10,000
to get your hair done or something?

158
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,080
A haircut? It's very cheap!

159
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,200
Care to come in for a bit?

160
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,200
Thanks.

161
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:17,560
I'm good.

162
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,120
I'm... I'm looking for Huilian.

163
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,200
Hui... Huilian?

164
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,200
Wu Huilian?

165
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,440
What are you doing squatting here?

166
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:29,200
The car...

167
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,200
Can you afford to pay if you scratch the car?

168
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,480
Come here, come here, come here.

169
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,080
Handsome, handsome!

170
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,680
Huilian is right here.

171
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,320
He's looking for you.

172
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:41,960
Hello, Boss Xiao Jiang.

173
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,080
What brings you here?

174
00:08:43,560 --> 00:08:45,280
I... I heard you found a job.

175
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,200
Like a bloodhound.

176
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,920
You catch on way too fast.

177
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,280
I...

178
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,880
I'm here to drop you off at work.

179
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:55,960
No need, no need.

180
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,400
You don't have to go to the trouble.

181
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:59,040
I can just take the bus myself.

182
00:08:59,040 --> 00:08:59,880
It's only a few stops.

183
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,640
It's very close.

184
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:01,800
Right.

185
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,200
Here, these flowers are for you.

186
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,520
To celebrate you finding a new job.

187
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:14,640
Huilian.

188
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:17,600
Get on, I'll give you a ride.

189
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,360
My friend is here to give me a ride.

190
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,480
You damn chicken!

191
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,680
I really don't have a free hand.

192
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,640
Thank you for the flowers.

193
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:28,880
Get on, Huilian.

194
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,720
Hold on tight.

195
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:36,800
Okay, bye.

196
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:38,760
Let's go, hurry.

197
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,280
Go, go.

198
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,520
I brought the hotpot soup base!

199
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,920
I have hands!

200
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,240
Xiao Jiang.

201
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:52,440
I didn't know you were into mature women.

202
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,160
I'll take these flowers for Huilian.

203
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,360
Fair enough.

204
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,280
Thanks!

205
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:05,640
Sure enough.

206
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,040
In this world...

207
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,240
there really are women...

208
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,920
who would rather laugh on an e-bike...

209
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:12,120
than cry in a sports car.

210
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,240
How's it going?

211
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,640
How many sessions did you do yesterday?

212
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,640
Not many. You?

213
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,440
Same here.

214
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,760
Business has been super slow lately.

215
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,520
Hello.

216
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,240
Hello, everyone.

217
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:02,480
Hello.

218
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,960
I'm the new hire, Wu Huilian.

219
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,920
I'm definitely older than you all.

220
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,520
A lot older. You're all so young!

221
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,680
Oh, right.

222
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:14,200
I made this myself.

223
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,240
Hotpot base.

224
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:15,960
Smell it.

225
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,280
It smells so good.

226
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:19,320
Really good.

227
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,440
Here, there's one for everyone.

228
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,200
Thanks, Huilian.

229
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,120
I was just craving hotpot.

230
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:22,560
Here's yours.

231
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:22,920
Thanks.

232
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:23,920
And yours.

233
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:24,520
Thanks.

234
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,520
It really smells amazing.

235
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:27,520
Since you're stuck in there,

236
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,560
I brought it over to you.

237
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:29,240
Great.

238
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:30,160
It really does smell good.

239
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:31,160
Yeah.

240
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,360
My daughter...

241
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,320
works in Shanghai.

242
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,040
What are you doing? What's going on?

243
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:37,840
You,

244
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:39,440
get over here.

245
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:40,600
I...

246
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,680
I told you to buy 1-ply,

247
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,600
who told you to buy 3-ply?

248
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,160
B-Boss...

249
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,600
It's because a lot of customers complained

250
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,960
that 1-ply is too thin, so I...

251
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,760
Are they paying your salary,

252
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,520
or am I?

253
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:54,040
Have you no concept of cost control?

254
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:54,720
I...

255
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,000
I swear, I'm raising a bunch of brats.

256
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:02,040
Cheapskate. So stingy.

257
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,360
Newbie,

258
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:07,440
what are you muttering about?

259
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,640
I was saying...

260
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,120
your hairstyle looks so handsome!

261
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,440
And that shirt looks great too.

262
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,680
Don't try to sweet-talk me.

263
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:16,960
Xiaomei,

264
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,560
starting today,

265
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,760
she's under your wing.

266
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,040
Train her properly.

267
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,800
Tomorrow, she starts taking clients.

268
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:25,920
Yes, boss.

269
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,320
That's the boss?

270
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,160
Is he sick in the head?

271
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,040
I was gonna give him a box.

272
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,760
But I saw him acting crazy over there.

273
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,880
I don't even want to give it to him anymore.

274
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:51,960
Baixi.

275
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:54,640
What are you doing here?

276
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:57,680
I came to tell you...

277
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:58,480
Baixi!

278
00:12:58,680 --> 00:12:59,480
Hurry up!

279
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,120
The host family has rushed us several times already.

280
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:02,840
Got it. Coming right away!

281
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,960
I have an urgent job here. I gotta go right now.

282
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,400
How about I call you after I'm done?

283
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,080
Go ahead with your work.

284
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,240
Alright, I'm heading out.

285
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:50,920
Who upset you again?

286
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,280
Who else but Wu Huilian?

287
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:56,520
What's up with Aunt Huilian now?

288
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:59,080
Her? She got a new job.

289
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,360
Isn't that a good thing?

290
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,280
She went and became an "Angel Baby."

291
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,920
What kind of baby?

292
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,440
Angel Baby.

293
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,000
Supposedly...

294
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,640
to a massage parlor...

295
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,600
to wash feet and give massages.

296
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,800
But that's actually pretty good.

297
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,120
Anyway,

298
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,960
didn't you just want her to get a stable job,

299
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,080
so you could go back to Shanghai?

300
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,480
I'm just worried it's not safe...

301
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:24,880
Forget it.

302
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:26,120
Let her do it.

303
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,040
Every place she works at goes under anyway.

304
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:29,160
She's an industry jinx.

305
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,520
If you ask me,

306
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,720
you should just stay here at Xiaoxitian,

307
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:35,360
and we'll build the business together.

308
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:36,600
What do you say?

309
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,400
Think about it.

310
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:47,680
Isn't it true that every time

311
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,360
you decide to take on a new job,

312
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:51,440
Aunt Huilian supports you unconditionally,

313
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,360
without saying a word?

314
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,320
So why is it that when she decides on a job,

315
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,680
she has to get your approval?

316
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,880
Everyone has their own path,

317
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:01,720
and they must walk it themselves.

318
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,920
Yeah, yeah, yeah, Boss Chen.

319
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:06,840
Where's your brother?

320
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:09,040
He called me over, but he's nowhere to be seen.

321
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:10,160
He and Brother Amin

322
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,440
went ahead to the People's Hospital.

323
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,160
Let's go.

324
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:14,400
A client booked a full funeral package this morning.

325
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,120
He told me to bring you along.

326
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,080
Do you know what he actually wants with me?

327
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,520
What else would my brother want with you?

328
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,320
To make money and pay off debts.

329
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:26,400
Tangtang!

330
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:27,560
Hurry, hurry!

331
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,360
Tangtang!

332
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,360
Don't fall asleep, Tangtang!

333
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,520
Sounds like Afu.

334
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:33,280
You go find your brother.

335
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:34,280
I'll go take a look.

336
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:39,400
Tangtang!

337
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,040
Tangtang, don't fall asleep!

338
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:41,880
Tangtang!

339
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,240
Tangtang, don't sleep!

340
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,080
Tangtang, hang in there!

341
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:46,400
Tangtang, don't sleep!

342
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,080
Hang in there!

343
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,120
Hang in there!

344
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:12,160
Bodhisattva bless us.

345
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,640
Bodhisattva bless us.

346
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:14,560
Bodhisattva bless us.

347
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,000
Bodhisattva bless us.

348
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,240
Bodhisattva bless us.

349
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:22,280
Bodhisattva bless us.

350
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,960
Dad, Dad!

351
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:28,680
Dad!

352
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,520
Dad, Dad!

353
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:17,520
Dad

354
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,440
Tangtang...

355
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:49,360
We still have so much left to do.

356
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,480
We haven't even had our wedding.

357
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,160
You can't leave me all alone.

358
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,960
Tangtang will be fine.

359
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,520
Let's sit down and wait.

360
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:09,120
Here.

361
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:30,400
Yiran.

362
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:33,840
You probably don't know our background.

363
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,240
I grew up in an orphanage.

364
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:38,600
I got sick,

365
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:41,840
and didn't have much to live for anyway.

366
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:48,080
Tangtang and I met in a cancer support group.

367
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,720
God blessed me

368
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,280
and gave me a family.

369
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:01,600
Over the past three years,

370
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:03,960
I've wanted to give her a wedding every single day.

371
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,800
I work during the day,

372
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:13,520
and we run a street stall together at night.

373
00:19:15,280 --> 00:19:17,640
The money we make doesn't even cover our medical bills.

374
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:20,760
Then...

375
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,440
what about Tangtang's family?

376
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,800
She's from a single-parent family.

377
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,400
Once they found out she was sick,

378
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,640
they took off overnight.

379
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,320
The patient has been resuscitated,

380
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,480
but she is still in a coma.

381
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,960
As for when she'll wake up,

382
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,040
it's really hard to say.

383
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:50,520
We need to keep her under observation.

384
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,760
Thank you, doctor. Thank you.

385
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:54,680
Please get up.

386
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:55,920
Get up, get up.

387
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:57,120
Get up.

388
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,480
It's just our job.

389
00:19:58,760 --> 00:19:59,440
I need to get back to work.

390
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,320
Thank you, doctor.

391
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:00,880
Thank you.

392
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:01,480
Thank you, doctor.

393
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:02,680
Thank you.

394
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,800
Good news.

395
00:20:04,120 --> 00:20:04,920
This is good news.

396
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:06,360
Thank the heavens.

397
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:07,280
Tangtang will be fine.

398
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:08,560
She'll definitely be fine.

399
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:09,520
Thank the heavens.

400
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:11,440
Thank the heavens. Thank the heavens.

401
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,360
Thank the heavens.

402
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:13,960
Thank the heavens.

403
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:18,400
Thank the heavens.

404
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,360
Thank the heavens.

405
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,080
Afu.

406
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,960
As for your wedding,

407
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:26,160
leave it to us.

408
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:33,000
You just promised Afu like that?

409
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:35,040
You aren't giving him false hope, are you?

410
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,640
Of course not.

411
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,160
Then how do you plan to do it?

412
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:41,280
For the wedding dress and props,

413
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:42,880
I'm thinking of borrowing them from Zhou Fang.

414
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,240
It shouldn't cost too much money.

415
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:47,240
As for the venue, we'll find a free one.

416
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:50,120
I haven't figured out the banquet yet.

417
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,040
Since you've said so,

418
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:55,320
count me in.

419
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,200
Count me in too.

420
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:01,080
I really do want to ask for your help.

421
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,400
This isn't your style.

422
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:07,480
You don't seem like someone who meddles.

423
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:14,240
When Tangtang was in the ER today,

424
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:17,240
I saw how devastated Afu was,

425
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:19,680
and it reminded me of my dad.

426
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:24,280
I didn't really understand back then.

427
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:27,200
But looking back now,

428
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:28,800
he probably still had

429
00:21:28,800 --> 00:21:30,640
so many unfulfilled wishes.

430
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:33,400
Now they're all just regrets.

431
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:41,600
Actually,

432
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:43,880
regret is a normal part of life.

433
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:46,760
Sometimes in life,

434
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:47,800
you have to learn to let go.

435
00:21:49,520 --> 00:21:51,560
But if you can make up for it, you must!

436
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:53,760
So I was thinking,

437
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:55,280
as long as Tangtang can recover,

438
00:21:55,280 --> 00:21:57,200
I must help them fulfill their wish.

439
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:58,800
I support you.

440
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,240
Afu!

441
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:27,000
Where have you been?

442
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,480
I've been waiting for you all day.

443
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:44,440
You're finally back.

444
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:56,600
Bro, I don't have enough cash right now.

445
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:00,560
Please give me a few more days.

446
00:23:02,520 --> 00:23:03,520
It's been three months.

447
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:06,360
You haven't paid for three months, right?

448
00:23:07,560 --> 00:23:08,360
Bro...

449
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,720
My girlfriend is sick.

450
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:14,520
I just paid for her surgery today.

451
00:23:15,120 --> 00:23:16,400
I don't have any money left.

452
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,520
I'll look for work first thing tomorrow.

453
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:20,440
I...

454
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:22,400
I'll definitely pay you back every cent.

455
00:23:25,120 --> 00:23:27,120
Pay me back every cent?

456
00:23:35,360 --> 00:23:36,360
Did I say I came here

457
00:23:36,360 --> 00:23:37,480
to ask for rent?

458
00:23:41,280 --> 00:23:42,080
Take it.

459
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,040
As long as she's okay.

460
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:46,880
Just take it.

461
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:47,880
No, no, no.

462
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:48,560
Take it!

463
00:23:48,560 --> 00:23:50,320
You're a grown man, stop dawdling.

464
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:53,160
It's my rent.

465
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,600
If I say I'm not taking it,

466
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,480
then I'm not taking it.

467
00:23:58,280 --> 00:23:59,080
I'm leaving.

468
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,240
Bro.

469
00:24:07,040 --> 00:24:07,840
Thank you.

470
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:11,200
Remember this.

471
00:24:11,840 --> 00:24:12,720
Both of you

472
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:16,040
make sure you stay alive.

473
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:18,920
Before I die,

474
00:24:22,080 --> 00:24:23,720
don't you dare die in my house.

475
00:25:14,120 --> 00:25:15,080
This is a pretty good job.

476
00:25:15,280 --> 00:25:16,560
It's really energizing.

477
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,120
Yeah.

478
00:25:18,120 --> 00:25:18,880
Bro.

479
00:25:19,320 --> 00:25:21,000
You gotta keep it up, too.

480
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,040
Guys,

481
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,080
for such a happy occasion,

482
00:25:58,320 --> 00:25:59,480
how could you leave me out?

483
00:26:01,760 --> 00:26:02,680
Don't worry.

484
00:26:02,880 --> 00:26:04,080
As for Afu and Tangtang's medical bills,

485
00:26:04,080 --> 00:26:04,840
I've already paid them.

486
00:26:05,080 --> 00:26:06,200
All you need to do is

487
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,640
focus on organizing his wedding.

488
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,080
Boss Zhou,

489
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:10,080
you're a stand-up guy.

490
00:26:17,560 --> 00:26:18,320
Xiaofang,

491
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:20,760
where... where do I put these flowers?

492
00:26:30,040 --> 00:26:31,040
I'll just put them here.

493
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,120
What else should I...

494
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,280
Zhou Fang,

495
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,520
come help me pump up these balloons.

496
00:26:38,360 --> 00:26:39,400
You got it, brother-in-law!

497
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,000
This thing...

498
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:45,760
how do I use it?

499
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:48,560
Push it in.

500
00:26:48,560 --> 00:26:49,520
Just pump it hard, right?

501
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:50,200
Yeah.

502
00:27:00,800 --> 00:27:01,760
How big should I make them?

503
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:03,240
The bigger, the better.

504
00:27:15,480 --> 00:27:16,360
Make them this big?

505
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:17,680
Yeah.

506
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,440
So clumsy.

507
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:24,200
Let's see who can do it better.

508
00:27:39,560 --> 00:27:40,520
Take a deep breath.

509
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:49,120
Okay, looking good.

510
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:50,440
Bro.

511
00:27:50,840 --> 00:27:51,360
In my whole life,

512
00:27:51,360 --> 00:27:52,640
this is my first time wearing a suit.

513
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:55,200
Clothes make the man.

514
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:56,400
Be confident.

515
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:02,080
I wrote this for you.

516
00:28:02,080 --> 00:28:03,200
Memorize it well.

517
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,880
You need to say it to the bride when we go in.

518
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:05,640
Okay.

519
00:28:07,080 --> 00:28:07,880
And here's yours.

520
00:28:08,120 --> 00:28:09,200
Don't mess this up again.

521
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:10,680
This time, it's a real wedding.

522
00:28:11,600 --> 00:28:12,400
Don't worry.

523
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:19,000
Are you ready?

524
00:28:20,800 --> 00:28:21,600
Let's go in.

525
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:32,000
Honored guests,

526
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:33,360
dear friends,

527
00:28:34,120 --> 00:28:36,560
it is with immense joy

528
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:37,920
that we gather to witness

529
00:28:38,280 --> 00:28:39,760
the groom, Mr. Sun Yongfu,

530
00:28:39,760 --> 00:28:43,440
and the bride, Miss Xu Tangtang, in their happy union.

531
00:28:46,240 --> 00:28:48,160
I'm your host, Chen Baixi.

532
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:50,120
On behalf of the newlyweds,

533
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:52,040
I would like to extend to our friends here

534
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:54,160
the warmest welcome

535
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,960
and most sincere gratitude.

536
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:02,800
Mr. Sun Yongfu,

537
00:29:03,680 --> 00:29:06,520
please take your love and promises

538
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:08,800
and walk toward your bride.

539
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:25,080
Mr. Sun Yongfu,

540
00:29:25,080 --> 00:29:26,600
do you promise to be

541
00:29:26,600 --> 00:29:29,040
the one Miss Xu Tangtang can rely on,

542
00:29:29,280 --> 00:29:30,320
through any storm,

543
00:29:31,040 --> 00:29:33,520
for better or for worse,

544
00:29:34,280 --> 00:29:36,520
in sickness and in health,

545
00:29:37,080 --> 00:29:39,360
to always love and respect her,

546
00:29:40,080 --> 00:29:41,600
and walk hand in hand with her for life?

547
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:44,800
I do.

548
00:29:48,040 --> 00:29:48,600
Now,

549
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:51,640
will the bride and groom please exchange rings.

550
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,200
Thank you.

551
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,120
Tangtang,

552
00:30:18,120 --> 00:30:19,400
This wedding,

553
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:22,200
we've been looking forward to it for so long.

554
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:24,240
Today, with everyone's help,

555
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:27,080
we really made it happen.

556
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:34,400
These past three years,

557
00:30:37,840 --> 00:30:39,240
we've been through a lot.

558
00:30:41,520 --> 00:30:43,120
I so wish you could see this.

559
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,000
Before I met you,

560
00:30:52,120 --> 00:30:54,280
even a sip of water tasted bitter to me.

561
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:58,240
You were the one who put a piece of candy in my mouth,

562
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:00,720
and let me taste sweetness.

563
00:31:09,920 --> 00:31:11,080
Today, at our wedding,

564
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:13,960
I'm going to sing your favorite song for you.

565
00:31:14,760 --> 00:31:16,040
I hope you can hear it.

566
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:23,320
I am the duckweed, you are the water.

567
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:30,440
Meeting and loving is no sin.

568
00:31:31,080 --> 00:31:34,800
The earth weeps endlessly, the heavens shed eternal tears.

569
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:38,720
Dyeing my blood red for you.

570
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:46,280
I wish to fly side by side with you.

571
00:31:46,280 --> 00:31:50,160
I wish to fly side by side with you.

572
00:31:51,760 --> 00:31:55,480
Having you in this life is like a dream.

573
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:01,880
In the next life, I'll wait for you to intoxicate me.

574
