Tangtang

584
00:33:19,520 --> 00:33:20,480
You're awake.

585
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:29,800
I heard your voice.

586
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:36,360
I was really scared you wouldn't wake up.

587
00:33:39,120 --> 00:33:40,440
Silly.

588
00:33:44,520 --> 00:33:46,160
Even if I'm in heaven,

589
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:47,400
