590
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:48,280
Don't say that.

591
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:49,560
Today...

592
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:51,160
Today is our wedding day.

593
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:52,120
You can't say that.

594
00:34:00,080 --> 00:34:01,440
You've lost so much weight.

595
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:03,240
When I get better,

596
00:34:03,360 --> 00:34:06,000
