597
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,640
To help you gain it all back, okay?

598
00:34:08,640 --> 00:34:09,400
Okay.

599
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:10,680
Whatever you say.

600
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,560
The auspicious time has come.

601
00:34:22,640 --> 00:34:24,640
You may now kiss the bride.

602
00:34:25,680 --> 00:34:28,520
Great!

603
00:34:36,080 --> 00:34:37,840
At this very moment,

604
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:40,000
