616
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:26,440
Meeting you

617
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,760
made the salt sprinkled on my wounds

618
00:35:29,040 --> 00:35:31,240
crystallize into sweet frosting.

619
00:35:32,200 --> 00:35:33,480
Meeting you,

620
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:34,280
from then on,

621
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:37,920
