637
00:36:22,600 --> 00:36:23,720
It builds good karma.

638
00:36:25,200 --> 00:36:27,400
I'm in contact with a company in Shanghai.

639
00:36:28,640 --> 00:36:30,560
I'll be going back to work soon.

640
00:36:38,400 --> 00:36:39,200
